bug_descriptions |bug_id, line_num, content|
    struct_two_traits_same_method_resolve_silently_native_2026-11-26, 0, "Two traits that both declare mark, both implemented for one struct in the same module or across provider/consumer modules: previously silently picked one impl by declaration order. MIR lowering (struct_inherent_method_syms, struct_trait_method_ambiguous, hir_impl_method_provenance_v1, register_struct_impl_method_v1, ensure_provider_session_v1, provider_method_materialize_v1, declaration_providers_v1, bootstrap_type_registration, check_struct_trait_method_ambiguity_v1) now tracks inherent vs trait impl provenance across lazy, eager, declaration-repository, and flat-bootstrap paths with module-qualified key isolation, preserves inherent precedence and single-trait/trait-typed resolution, and emits fatal ambiguous trait method diagnostics on unqualified ambiguous calls. Unit spec struct_two_traits_same_method_ambiguity_spec.spl passes 9/9 in --mode=interpreter; native Stage 2/3 rebuild verification pending."

bugs_active |id, severity, status, title, file, line, reproducible_by, created_at, updated_at, valid|
    struct_two_traits_same_method_resolve_silently_native_2026-11-26, P2, fix-implemented-verification-pending, "Native: same-name methods from two traits on one struct resolve silently to one impl instead of an ambiguity error", src/compiler/50.mir/_MirLoweringExpr/method_calls_literals.spl, 3170, test/01_unit/compiler/50.mir/struct_two_traits_same_method_ambiguity_spec.spl, 2026-11-26, 2026-11-27, true

bug_investigation_logs |bug_id, line_num, content|
    struct_two_traits_same_method_resolve_silently_native_2026-11-26, 0, "2026-11-27 w3-1: tracked trait vs inherent impl provenance in MirLowering via hir_impl_method_provenance_v1 across lazy session (provider_metadata.spl), eager provider pass (module_lowering.spl), declaration repository (declaration_providers_v1.spl), and flat bootstrap registration (bootstrap_type_registration.spl), plus exact-owner isolation in check_struct_trait_method_ambiguity_v1 (error_fatal in method_calls_literals.spl). test/01_unit/compiler/50.mir/struct_two_traits_same_method_ambiguity_spec.spl passes 9/9 (--mode=interpreter); native Stage 2/3 rebuild verification pending."
